# Titan 2 mtk-pmic-keys (event1): POWER plus occasional side scan echoes.
# Map POWER only. WAKE is required: without it InputReader drops POWER while
# display is off (sleep works, unlock/wake dead — 2026-08-11 lab).
# Scans 249/250 must stay unmapped so sides never become
# system Home/Camera via Generic.kl fallback (B1 belt).
key 116   POWER   WAKE
# key 249 intentionally omitted (side · top)
# key 250 intentionally omitted (side · bottom)
